---
title: Example · Feature prioritization
config:
  look: classic
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    quadrant1Fill: "#2a2a2a"
    quadrant2Fill: "#242424"
    quadrant3Fill: "#2a2a2a"
    quadrant4Fill: "#242424"
    quadrant1TextFill: "#b3b3b3"
    quadrant2TextFill: "#b3b3b3"
    quadrant3TextFill: "#b3b3b3"
    quadrant4TextFill: "#b3b3b3"
    quadrantPointFill: "#93c5fd"
    quadrantPointTextFill: "#e0e0e0"
    quadrantXAxisTextFill: "#e0e0e0"
    quadrantYAxisTextFill: "#e0e0e0"
    quadrantInternalBorderStrokeFill: "#6b6b6b"
    quadrantExternalBorderStrokeFill: "#8a8a8a"
    quadrantTitleFill: "#e0e0e0"
---
%% Axes run `low --> high`; quadrant-1 is top right, then counterclockwise: 2 top left, 3 bottom left, 4 bottom right.
%% Points take `[x, y]` in 0–1; `:::class` with `classDef` marks the point under discussion.
%% A body `title …` line is the alternative to frontmatter `title`.
quadrantChart
  x-axis Low effort --> High effort
  y-axis Low impact --> High impact
  quadrant-1 Plan · big bets
  quadrant-2 Do now · quick wins
  quadrant-3 Skip · low value
  quadrant-4 Rethink · costly fill-ins
  Saved carts: [0.25, 0.72]
  One-click pay:::em: [0.38, 0.9]
  Search rewrite: [0.82, 0.78]
  Dark mode: [0.2, 0.3]
  Legacy export: [0.7, 0.18]
  classDef em color: #86efac, radius: 8
